WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.520
They're all together!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.750
It's our bond!

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.220
This is our hope!

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.800
He was in a lot of trouble, but he managed 
to summon three Synchro Monsters.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.370
Is this the power of the Signers?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.360
Here I go, Aporia!

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.510
No matter how much despair you 
give, our hopes will never vanish!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.140
All right!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.980
Impressive, Yusei Fudo.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.160
Our three monsters have resurrected!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.670
Go, Yusei!

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:49.430
Yeah!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.360
I activate Black-Winged Dragon's effect!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:01:00.380
By removing all Black Feather Counters, your 
monster loses 700 attack points for each Counter.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:04.040
You also take damage equal to 
the decrease in attack points!

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.940
Black-Winged Dragon has two Counters.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:12.320
Therefore, Mekanikle 
loses 1400 attack points!

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:16.150
You also take the same amount 
as damage!  Black Burst!

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:30.240
Since Black-Winged Dragon has no Black 
Feather Counters, it gains 1400 attack points!

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:34.900
Black-Winged Dragon has more 
attack points than Mekanikle!

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.570
Black-Winged Dragon, attack 
Meklord Astro Mekanikle!

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.580
Noble Stream!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.420
I activate Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.350
By removing a Meklord Emperor 
part in my graveyard from play,

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.820
Mekanikle isn't destroyed!

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.360
I remove Granel Guard from play!

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.830
Yusei, finish him at once!

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.860
Go, Red Nova Dragon!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.840
Burning Soul!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:15.940
I activate Meklord Astro Mekanikle's effect!

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:21.050
By removing Granel Attack in my graveyard 
from play, Mekanikle isn't destroyed!

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.320
Hooray!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.550
He only has 500 life points left!

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:32.200
Impossible...  Am I going to lose?

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:33.160
Aporia!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.400
Our hopes overcome your despair!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.150
This is the final attack!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.470
Go, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.060
Stardust Mirage!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:11.730
We've come this far only to fail?

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.370
Yusei.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:51.980
Jack.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.170
We did it.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:54.970
Yeah.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.290
We won!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.580
It's over!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:10.320
The WRGP Finals had many 
unexpected twists and turns!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.260
What a historic battle!

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:19.600
The first-ever champions that 
stand atop all D-Wheelers are...

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.970
Team 5D's!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.640
We did it!

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:36.010
We did it!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.350
We won!

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.440
We...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.850
You did it, Yusei.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:52.990
Well done, Team 5D's!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.380
Neo Domino City is saved!

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:05.540
It's the triumphant return of Jack 
Atlas, Crow Hogan and Yusei Fudo!

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:08.510
Yusei!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.360
Jack!  Crow!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:11.480
You did it!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.580
Yeah.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.920
Jack!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.020
You did it, Jack!

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.090
Master Atlas!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.640
You were wonderful!

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.260
It went as expected.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.960
Team 5D's.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.550
Team Ragnarok.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.200
You did it.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.000
You're thanking us too?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.670
Of course.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:37.960
We accept!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.880
Everyone, congratulations.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.340
Mizoguchi, you came back?

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.180
Yes.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.380
Thank you, everyone.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.700
I'm getting the scoop on 
the victory celebration!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:04.230
Iliaster's plans are over.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.130
What?

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:16.420
What's this?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.210
Hey!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:21.880
What's happening?

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.940
The sky is shattering.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:30.320
No way...

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:42.000
That's Ark Cradle!

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.530
Riding Duels.

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:48.700
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:55.290
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:07:03.320
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:07.840
Is a new legendary duel

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:24.890
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:30.450
Set free your infinite potential

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:36.050
Every beginning is up to you

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:42.660
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:47.960
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:53.540
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:07:55.500 --> 00:08:01.450
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:06.580
Even if you can't see your destination

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:12.050
Run on your feet without fear

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:17.930
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:25.550
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:34.480
Approaching Terror
God's Castle "Ark Cradle"

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.410
What is that?

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.390
It's humongous!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.920
Impossible!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:59.870
Since we won, Ark Cradle shouldn't appear!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.480
But it's actually here!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:06.250
It finally appeared.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:12.350
Ark Cradle is mankind's final Moment 
that they brought from the future.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.160
Z-one...

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.850
You're really going to 
destroy Neo Domino City.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.720
Team 5D's!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:21.680
Yeager!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:24.090
Go to the Public Maintenance 
Department immediately!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:28.010
Let's plan a strategy with 
the information we have!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:28.760
Understood.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.730
I'll come with you.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:34.600
Section Chief Sagiri, 
let's return to our posts.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:38.530
Right.  You get away as far as possible.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.810
Okay!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.280
Oh my!  Moment is spinning!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.250
But it's stopping!

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.060
The output is down to 30%!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.990
And it continues to fall!

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:56.690
If this doesn't change, Moment will stop!

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:59.290
Check the system program!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.330
Also inspect all other systems!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:12.970
What?

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:14.730
The power is dropping.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:15.670
Same here.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.860
My D-Wheel's Moment is...

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:21.670
It's no good.  It won't move.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.150
What's going on?

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.850
Is it a blackout?

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.320
What's going on?

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.160
System down!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.030
All systems in the facility have stopped!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.100
Switch to auxiliary power!

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:37.530
Right!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.940
Director, the old Moment located 
in the BAD Area is active.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.090
What?

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.890
It's spinning in the opposite direction.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.340
The old Moment!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.770
Is this because of Ark Cradle?

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.380
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:03.230
Director, Chief Akutsu is contacting us.

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.120
Answer it!

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:07.600
Director Yeager!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.530
While I was getting dizzy, 
I discovered many answers!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:17.870
That object is Moment with negative spin!

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.330
Negative spin?

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.140
See for yourself!

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.930
This is satellite analysis of that object.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:34.250
At its center is a huge Moment surrounded by 
three Yusei Gears, and it has negative spin!

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:39.450
It's causing Neo Domino City's 
Moments to stop spinning.

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:42.460
Correct!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:50.890
As long as it continues to spin in the opposite 
direction, all Moments in Neo Domino City are stopped.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:55.510
And there's something more terrifying!

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:01.940
That object is gradually falling.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.080
What?

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:08.170
At this rate, it will crash 
land in twelve hours!

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:14.150
The impact will spread several hundred 
kilometers beyond Neo Domino City!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:21.160
Only twelve hours...

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:28.470
How long will it take to evacuate 
everyone from Neo Domino City?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.290
It will take at least 24 hours.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.610
That's not enough time!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:36.500
I must let the people know 
that there's an emergency!

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:39.880
Route emergency power to the city's monitors!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.470
I give up.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.580
To everyone in Neo Domino City,

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:48.010
this is Yeager, the Director of 
the Public Maintenance Department.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:49.930
Please stay calm and listen.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.700
There is an emergency.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.560
Citizens of Neo Domino City, 
please evacuate quickly.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.240
Evacuate?

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.530
What does he mean?

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:03.390
Please don't panic while 
dealing with this situation.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.440
There's still time.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:09.240
The object in the sky is gradually falling.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:13.210
The elderly, children and the 
hospitalized are top priority.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.600
What?

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.010
It's falling?

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:19.560
You must be kidding!

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.200
Everyone, please listen!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:39.380
Evacuate immediately.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.990
What about you, Director?

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:46.650
I won't leave my post until the end.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:47.510
Yeager...

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.210
But that means...

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.730
I order all staff to evacuate immediately!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:57.050
I pray for your safety.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.570
Stephanie!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:09.080
What's wrong?  Leave immediately!

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:12.730
But I want to bring the Blue-Eyes 
Mountain coffee beans with me!

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:14.440
Forget about it!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:16.910
But Jack likes them!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:20.380
Let's hurry up and leave, Mom!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.600
You go alone.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.850
I'm staying here with your 
father's handmade clocks.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.420
What are you talking about?

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.270
If you stay here, you're going to be crushed!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.050
That's fine.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:35.550
This store is everything to me.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.320
Enough nonsense!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.930
We can always rebuild the store!

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.930
If it's about my father's clocks, 
I'll make better ones than his!

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:47.400
I won't let you die until 
you have grandchildren!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.510
Okay.  I'll go.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.980
Get on.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.650
Hurry up.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.710
No one's left, right?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.360
I'm surprised you found this bus.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.840
I used to run a junkyard.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.200
I never thought that a gas-powered 
vehicle would come in handy.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.930
We can escape to the outskirts.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.140
Let's get going.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.170
Martha.

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.440
Is it really going to fall?

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.640
Is Neo Domino City going to be destroyed?

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.930
Don't worry bout that!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.440
We're just evacuating further away.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:34.110
Jack, Crow and Yusei will protect this city!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.100
Oh yeah!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.220
You're right!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.500
Let's go.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:46.360
Everyone, thanks for coming.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:51.790
Actually, not many of you have stayed behind.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:54.200
Yeah.  Most ran away.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.370
After seeing something 
that, it's understandable.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:04.190
Anyway, vehicles that use Moment don't work.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:09.350
But we have to evacuate as many citizens 
as possible before time runs out.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:12.230
This is a battle against time!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:15.240
There's no guarantee that we'll survive.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.720
Leave now if you don't want to help.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:26.560
Okay!  Your lives are now in 
Section Chief Sagiri and my hands!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.580
Use electric vehicles to 
transport hospital patients!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.770
The rest will lead the citizens!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.170
Save as many lives as possible!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:36.870
Understood!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.460
Move it!

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.840
We won't be able to escape!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.080
Stop pushing!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.080
Hey, that vehicle is moving!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.820
This vehicle is carrying the sick.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.790
Please stay back!  It's dangerous!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.240
Let me ride!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.840
Please!  I have a child!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:57.580
This situation is out of control.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:29.160
My comrade Aporia, I still need your power.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.430
Give me your power.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.670
Z-one, I lost?

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:36.680
Yes.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:40.670
I'm sorry that I couldn't 
fulfill our promise.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.670
But something unexpected has happened.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.140
Something unexpected?

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:53.290
In our plan, your victory 
would've completed the Circuit

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:55.860
and caused Ark Cradle to appear.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:18:02.360
But Ark Cradle appeared above Neo 
Domino City even though you failed.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.580
So our plan is still moving forward?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.560
But something different is happening.

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:15.370
Something may be changing the future.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:20.110
Something is changing the 
future...  Is it Team 5D's?

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:22.130
Most likely.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:25.660
However, the future isn't changing enough.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.120
Aporia, I need your help 
to change the future again.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.980
Of course.

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.940
I am your eternal friend.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:43.060
I'm pointing all remote control 
cameras at Ark Cradle.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.450
We might learn something.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:52.770
What's that?

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:55.840
Is that a destroyed city?

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:56.980
What's going on?

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:02.150
Bruno, enlarge the image!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.150
Okay.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.560
What?

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.770
That's the Daedalus Bridge!

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:21.230
Can it be?  It's Satellite from the future!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.940
So it's true?

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.440
Neo Domino City is going to be destroyed?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:28.810
Isn't there any way to stop Ark Cradle?

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.980
Can't we do anything?

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:34.950
Maybe we can.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.010
What?

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:37.260
Really?

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:38.050
Bruno?

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:46.620
The Moment at the center of 
Ark Cradle has negative spin.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:50.260
If we strike it with large positive spin...

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:55.450
The negative spin will become positive spin.

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:56.620
I see.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:20:00.720
But there are no Moments 
in the city that work.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:06.680
There's nothing we can do.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.940
You must evacuate immediately!

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.020
What's that?

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:15.990
What is it?

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.920
Team Ragnarok!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.230
They're riding D-Wheels!

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:30.730
Team Ragnarok, why are your D-Wheels working?

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.600
You haven't figured it out?

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.340
It's because of this.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.040
The Rune Eye?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:43.520
Just like how Iliaster couldn't affect us,

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.600
negative Moment can't affect us either.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:48.570
I see!  That means our D-Wheels...

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:56.030
They work!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.880
We can still ride!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:58.660
Yeah!

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.150
Hooray!

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:06.390
We can go to Ark Cradle.

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.930
That would be a mistake.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:10.770
Sherry!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:12.640
You're alive!

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.380
Ma'am!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:18.350
Yusei, I've seen the future.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:19.920
The future?

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:23.320
You shouldn't come to Ark Cradle.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:29.290
I saw you die at Ark Cradle.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.220
I'll die?

00:21:56.240 --> 00:22:01.450
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:06.830
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:12.200
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.990
Our hearts resonate

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:20.170
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:26.920
We'll find a place for us

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:33.840
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:39.020
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:45.130
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:53.400
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:59.210
We will draw it forever
